v {xschem version=3.4.6 file_version=1.2
* tx_top (issue #21; generated by design/tx/gen_schematics.py)
*
* TX high-speed path: final 2:1 mux (main and one-UI-delayed post-cursor
* copies), pre-drivers, FFE line driver, bias, FFE enable, CML-to-CMOS level
* converter and pad/ESD. The post-cursor streams dpa*/dpb* are the main
* streams delayed by one UI; the digital serializer must supply them
* (interface requirement on the digital partition).
*
* First-cut sizing for the PROPOSED draft spec rows; not a spec result and
* not a measurement. Traces to sim/pdk.json.
